msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Walk through the [SKQD](skqd#skqd-getting-started) guide to see [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\") and [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") used together to sample circuits built from this package’s gates, and to evaluate a Hamiltonian expectation value through [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\") (itself backed by the same `_linear_operator_` protocol method described here).\n"
msgstr "Ikuti panduan [SKQD](skqd#skqd-getting-started) untuk melihat [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\") dan [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") digunakan bersama untuk mensampel litar yang dibina daripada gate pakej ini, dan untuk menilai nilai jangkaan Hamiltonian melalui [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\") (yang itu sendiri disokong oleh kaedah protokol `_linear_operator_` yang sama seperti yang diterangkan di sini).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
